pack mkp-data@1 "Data pieces over the base set: relation tables, query steps, joins, groups, operator trees and truth tables."
  requires core@1
  provides relation reltable rel rrow cell number shownum compare mdtable rrowof rrowoff rrowhead opsym sqlval aggvalues aggval agglabel aggsql mdrows query join group optree opnode optnode postorder popnode truth tf
